<body lang=EN-US link="#0563C1" vlink="#954F72">
    <div class=WordSection1>
        <blockquote style='margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt'>
            <div>
                <p class=MsoNormal>Hello {!Opportunity.OwnerFullName},
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:15.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;background:white'><span lang=EN>Based on our review of the Export questionnaire that you completed for your MAG opportunity referenced in this email, you have approval with conditions to <b><u>proceed provided you stay within the guardrails below</u></b>:</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Do not provide any technical advice or assistance including code or SW optimization that supports a defense, space, or military related end use or end item</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Do not provide training that relates to any military, defense, or space-related requirements or defense articles</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Do not provide information or technology relating to the production, development or use of Intel products in a defense, space, or military end item or application (beyond information required to ensure safe operation of our products).</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:15.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;background:white'><b><span lang=EN>If the customer wants more information or assistance that goes beyond these guidelines or if requirements for military, defense, or space articles are later introduced by the customer, please contact Intel&#8217;s Trade Department immediately before proceeding further. If you understand your responsibility and can comply with the guidelines above, </span></b><b><span lang=EN style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"'>please reply with &quot;Yes&quot; in the body of your email. If you are unable to comply with the guidelines above, please reply with &quot;No&quot; in the body of your email; GEC will follow up with you to discuss the opportunity or opportunities.</span></b><span lang=EN style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Helvetica","sans-serif"'>&nbsp;</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:15.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;background:white'><span lang=EN>Following are examples of information that CAN be shared with the customer:</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Basic marketing material</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Product roadmap</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Product samples</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Electronic design kits</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Marketing information about product capabilities, features, and how to use them. </span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;margin-right:15.0pt;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;background:white'><span lang=EN>Following are examples of activities that are outside the guardrails above, can NOT be shared, and will require prior GEC notification/approval:</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Facilitate design-in services on the Customer&#8217;s board modified for MAG customers </span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Facilitate co&#8211;development solutions with Customers supporting MAG defense end items</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:69.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>General consensus is that Intel does not assist the Customer on Co-Development solutions; however, it is possible for Intel technicians to provide co-development support.</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Facilitate the development of working prototypes in response to any specific capabilities or markets Provide POCs (Proof of Concept) in response to any specific defense capabilities or markets</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:69.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:"Courier New"'>o</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>General consensus is that Intel does not assist the Customer on working prototypes; however, it is possible for Intel technicians to build prototypes with the Customer&#8217;s design information.</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Facilitate design reviews of Customer&#8217;s MAG board design (schematics and layouts) </span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Schematic review &#8211; Input/Outputs (I/Os, connectivity issues, interfaces, components</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Layout review &#8211; Board construction, Layer builds, interconnect guidelines, voltage evaluation, or evaluating against topology conditions provided. </span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Create a custom designed microprocessors for a defense/aerospace end item</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Perform technical support or military training for any defense/aerospace end item</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Discuss missile technology</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Enable or support the development of weapons systems</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:33.0pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Reference or perform comparison to US Government systems, programs or operations</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='mso-margin-top-alt:3.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:33.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;background:white'><span lang=EN style='font-family:Symbol'>·</span><span lang=EN style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=EN>Discuss, offer or release US Government tactics, doctrine, rules of engagement or employment methods</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN>&nbsp;</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:14.65pt;vertical-align:baseline'><b><u>IMPORTANT:</u></b>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='text-indent:-.25in;line-height:14.65pt;vertical-align:baseline'><span style='font-family:Wingdings'>Ø</span><span style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp; </span>Should any of your previous responses change, the approval status may change accordingly.&nbsp; Please contact GEC as soon as you determine your prior response needs updating.
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoListParagraph style='text-indent:-.25in;line-height:14.65pt;vertical-align:baseline'><span style='font-family:Wingdings'>Ø</span><span style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"'>&nbsp; </span>The scope of this approval is limited to GEC&#8217;s review of the opportunity based on your responses and the relationship to a military, aerospace or government project.&nbsp; All the other requirements, internal and external, beyond export controls must be met according to the specific policies, rules and regulations (if applicable) prior to moving forward with the opportunity.
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal>Please let us know if you have any questions or concerns.
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#1F497D'>&nbsp;</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal>Best regards,
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#1F497D'>&nbsp;</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:black'>Global Export </span>Compliance / Global Tax &amp; Trade
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal><a href="mailto:Export.customer@intel.com">Export.customer@intel.com</a><span style='color:black'> </span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:#1F497D'>&nbsp;</span>
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
                <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;
                    <o:p></o:p>
                </p>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</body>
